# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Secrets. `*.local` above already covers .env.local, but only by accident of
# its name — these make the rule explicit and cover any other variant. The
# example file is the one that is meant to be public.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local agent config. Machine-specific, and settings.json accumulates the
# literal commands that were approved on this machine — including ones with
# a live API key in the argument list.
.claude/

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
